as a strong wolf who must protect the weak pushes him to investigate the incident. To further complicate his life, he struggles to manage his complex feelings for the white rabbit, Haru.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\n\n\nNote: The first episode had an early delivery on Netflix Japan on January 5, 2021. The regular TV broadcast started on January 7, 2021."],"ja":["BEASTARS 第2期",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-31854":"2022-02-21T08:51:24Z","serial-31925":"2021-05-30T15:10:19Z","serial-31627":"2021-04-12T02:55:35Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-31854","serial-31925","serial-31627"],"relatedMalIds":[39195,49469],"availableEpisodeCount":12,"rating":7.75,"relations":[{"id":39195,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":49469,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}